  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO/Government Strategic Health Conference</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protecting Yemen&apos;s Health System: Pre-YGP donor coordination summit to enhance coordination and strategic alignment of the key health donor to Yemen &amp; ahead of the upcoming Yemen Partners Group (YGP) meeting. UK (FCDO) alongside the Yemen&apos;s Minister of Health will host a one -day strategic health donor coordination summit in Aden.</narrative>
  </description>
